        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Mintz\n- Companies: Enron Corporation, Arthur Andersen\n- Roles: Managing Director for Corporate Tax, whistleblower\n- Events: Enron scandal, Enron bankruptcy, Arthur Andersen dissolution\n- Places: Houston, Texas\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Mintz was a whistleblower and a former Managing Director for Corporate Tax at Enron Corporation.\n- The Enron scandal was publicized in October 2001.\n- Enron Corporation was an American energy company based in Houston, Texas.\n- The Enron scandal eventually led to the bankruptcy of Enron Corporation.\n- The Enron scandal also led to the de facto dissolution of Arthur Andersen, one of the five largest audit and accountancy partnerships in the world.",
